Additional Terms for BhashaBridge:

This software is specifically designed for rural communities and 
multilingual voice corpus building. Any network use or distribution 
of this software must ensure that the source code remains available 
to all users, including those in rural areas with limited internet 
connectivity.

NOTICE: This project is part of the Swecha initiative for digital 
empowerment in Indian languages.
